  </tr>
  <tr ID="problem-5">
    <td>Moderate exacerbation of COPD with a viral cold: more breathlessness, more sputum turning green, and wheeze for three days; oxygen saturation 92 percent; no pneumonia on chest X-ray; treated at home with prednisone and doxycycline; recovered</td><td>resolved</td><td>confirmed</td>
